Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">根據您需要的貸款類型，您將有很多選擇。獲得個人貸款的最快和最簡單的方法是去與您已經有關係的銀行。通過與一個人坐下來討論貸款申請，他們通常可以當場批准您。另外，您的貸款將在同一家銀行，這使得付款管理更加輕鬆。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:16.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt">3.</span></b><b><span style="font-size:16.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
11.0pt;font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:
minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin">您每月可以負擔多少錢</span></b><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:16.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">既然您已經確定了為什麼需要這筆錢，並且獲得貸款符合您的最佳財務利益，那麼您將需要考慮可以實際負擔（並償還）多少。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">負擔這個詞很棘手。僅僅因為您可以支付每月還款額，並不意味著您實際上可以負擔得起貸款。實際上，哈佛大學最近的一項研究表明，將近</span><span lang="EN-US">4000</span><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">萬美國人生活在他們負擔不起的房屋貸款。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">汽車貸款也是相似的。</span><span lang="EN-US">Bankrate</span><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:
minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin">的一項研究表明，大多數家庭再也買不起普通的新車，在美國有</span><span lang="EN-US">6400</span><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">萬駕駛員無力提供僅</span><span lang="EN-US">500</span><span style="font-family:
&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;
mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:
Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin">美元或</span><span lang="EN-US">600</span><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:
minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin">美元的汽車維修費用。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:16.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt">4.</span></b><b><span style="font-size:16.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
11.0pt;font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:
minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin">您的信用評分（信用記錄）</span></b><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:16.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">既然您知道了自己真正有能力負擔的借貸和還本付息，那麼現在該弄清楚您有資格獲得哪種貸款和利率。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">您的信用評分和信用記錄是您財務狀況的命脈。沒有特別良好的信用，您將無法取得較低的利率以及較高的貸款額度。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p>











































































