Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">章也都在說不要借錢給他人。因而，缺錢時，向他人借錢就需要把握一定的策略。以下就分享向他人借錢的六大策略！一旦把握，借錢就不是難事。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span><a target="_blank" href="https://tyl777.com"><img src="/docs/summerNote_img/images/20210423/20210423175244_53319.png" style="width: 100%;" alt="貸款資訊" title="貸款專家"></a></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">一、先想一想你的關係</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">假設是關係比較好的人，你對他的經濟情況知根知底，那借錢時無妨直截一點，可假設與對方關係一般，則盡量要含蓄一些，用商議的口氣，有些人借錢時過於想當然，說話過於直接，以為對方既然</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">有錢，那借給自己就是應該的，卻不知，有求於人時，就要有有求於人的情緒。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">二、朋友是朋友，錢是錢</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">人心是經不起檢測的，尤其是面臨金錢時。不註意將朋友和錢的關係分開，就容易導致朋友的關係破裂。與朋友相交就應該金錢分明，不管是借錢給朋友，仍是向朋友借錢，都要先小人然後君子，先</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">明確定下還錢的時間，避免影響朋友之間的友情。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">三、借錢要一點一點地借</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">一些年歲較大的人應該都有這樣的閱歷，在火車站或汽車站買票時，總會有一些人到你面前說：“大哥（大姐），我買車票還差</span><span lang="EN-US">5</span><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">元錢，你能幫幫我嗎</span><span lang="EN-US">?</span><span style="font-family:
&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;
mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:
Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin">”這時，一些心腸較弱的人只要手中有錢，就會盡</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">量幫助，由於覺得</span><span lang="EN-US">5</span><span style="font-family:
&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;
mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:
Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin">元錢對自己來講是小數目。借錢時也是相同的道理，每次少借一點，既有利於你如期償還，又利於你消除對方的心理壓力，獲得對方的信賴。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">四、借錢被拒絕時，要盡量諒解對方</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">稍微愛面子、講自尊心的人，在向他人借錢時，都會感覺尷尬、不好意思乃至張不了口，但對對方也是同樣的尷尬，借吧，有諸多顧慮，不借吧，又怕損傷感情。所以，借錢被拒絕時，要盡量諒解對</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">方，這樣做的最大優點是，對方沒有的話，會很抱歉，乃至覺得有點對不住你，當你下次再借的時分，難度就有小許多。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">五、能借走錢，還要還回錢</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">“有借有還，再借不難”，這雖然是一句快被說濫了的老話，但卻也是千古不易的至理名言。借錢，要進步成功率，靠的是誠篤，靠的是信義。假設你借了他人的錢不還，或許不按時還，又或許還的極</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">不情願，乃至還有怨言，那麼，不只當你再借錢時，會被對方一口拒絕，你們的關係，許多時分，也就等於破裂了。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">六、不要讓另外的人還錢</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">如果沒有特殊情況，應“誰借誰還”，托人“轉手”既非常失禮，也或許呈現對立糾紛。切忌這樣說“我借了你多少錢，某某又借了我多少錢，請你到他那裡去要吧”，這等於讓人代你索債，換誰也不會</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>









































































</p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">高興，一旦對方索債不順利，那就更會對你發生怨言。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>","art_create_time":"2021-04-23 17:52:14"}

{"art_show":1,"art_top":0,"art_category":"借錢","art_title":"哪種借錢方式較划算呢？三種借貸方式比較","art_url":"哪種借錢方式較划算呢三種借貸方式比較","art_tag":"["借錢","借貸方式比較"]","art_content":"<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
