{"art_show":1,"art_top":0,"art_category":"借錢","art_title":"缺錢時，該如何正確借錢？六大策略，借錢就不難","art_url":"缺錢時該如何正確借錢六大策略借錢就不難","art_tag":"["借錢","小額借款"]","art_content":"<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">生活、作業、辦事、做生意，人生的許多場合，常會遇到一種令人尷尬的局面——缺錢</span><span lang="EN-US">!</span><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:
minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin">缺錢該怎麼辦？不用說，許多時候，就得去向別人借錢</span><span lang="EN-US">!</span><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">不過，錢在現代這個社會是一個非常靈敏的東西，許多文章也都在說不要借錢給別人。因此，缺錢時，向別人借錢就需要把握一定的戰略。以下就共用向別人借錢的六大戰略！一旦把握，</span><span lang="EN-US"><a href="https://tyl777.com/"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:
&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;
mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:
Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin">借錢</span></a></span><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:
minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin">就不是難事。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">一、先想一想你的關系</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">​<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">假設是關系比較好的人，你對他的經濟情況知根知底，那借錢時無妨直截一點，可假設與對方關系普通，則盡量要含蓄一些，用商量的口氣，有些人借錢時過於想當然，說話過於直接，認為對方既然有錢，那借給自己便是應該的，卻不知，有求於人時，就要有有求於人的態度。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">二、朋友是朋友，錢是錢</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">人心是經不起考驗的，尤其是面對金錢時。不註意將朋友和錢的關系分開，就簡單導致朋友的關系破裂。與朋友相交就應該錢財清楚，不管是借錢給朋友，還是向朋友借錢，都要先小人而後正人，先明確定下還錢的時間，以免影響朋友之間的友情。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">三、借錢要一點一點地借</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">一些年紀較大的人應該都有這樣的經歷，在火車站或汽車站買票時，總會有一些人到你面前說：“大哥（大姐），我買車票還差</span><span lang="EN-US">5</span><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">元錢，你能幫幫我嗎</span><span lang="EN-US">?</span><span style="font-family:
&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;
mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:
Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin">”這時，一些心腸較弱的人只要手中有錢，就會盡量幫忙，因為覺得</span><span lang="EN-US">5</span><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">元錢對自己來講是小數目。借錢時也是一樣的道理，每次少借一點，既有利於你按期歸還，又利於你消除對方的心理壓力，取得對方的信賴。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">四、借錢被拒絕時，要盡量體諒對方</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">略微愛體面、講自尊心的人，在向別人借錢時，都會感覺為難、不好意思乃至張不了口，但對對方也是同樣的為難，借吧，有諸多顧慮，不借吧，又怕傷害愛情。所以，借錢被拒絕時，要盡量體諒對方，這樣做的最大好處是，對方沒有的話，會很抱歉，乃至覺得有點對不住你，當你下次再借的時候，難度就有小許多。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">五、能借走錢，還要還回錢</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">“有借有還，再借不難”，這雖然是一句快被說濫了的老話，但卻也是千古不易的至理名言。借錢，要進步成功率，靠的是誠實，靠的是信義。假設你借了別人的錢不還，或許不準時還，又或許還的極不情願，乃至還有怨言，那麼，不僅當你再借錢時，會被對方一口拒絕，你們的關系，許多時候，也就等於破裂了。</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">六、不要讓另外的人還錢</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p>



























































</p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:
minor-latin">假如沒有特殊情況，應“誰借誰還”，托人“轉手”既非常失禮，也或許出現對立糾紛。切忌這樣說“我借了你多少錢，某某又借了我多少錢，請你到他那裡去要吧”，這等於讓人代你討債，換誰也不會高興，一旦對方討債不順利，那就更會對你產生怨言。</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><img src="/docs/summerNote_img/images/20211209/20211209115959_69056.png" style="width: 100%;" alt="借錢方式" title="借錢方式"><span style="font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:新細明體;
